    "updated_at": "2021-01-12T17:38:04Z",
    "body": "> Manjaro with Konsole, Breeze shell theme with Fira Code 10pt font from system repository.\r\n\r\nStarship requires the use of Nerd Font variants of fonts. In this case, you'll want to change the font your terminal is using to the version of Fira Code downloaded here: https://www.nerdfonts.com/font-downloads",
