    "updated_at": "2021-01-13T07:02:14Z",
    "body": "Thank you very much, it works now! Although, I installed `nerd-fonts-noto-sans-mono` and `ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols` from the official repository instead of replacing Fira Code, then `fc-cache -vf` to refresh the font cache, and restart Konsole. \r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/21174107/104417200-4c071800-5575-11eb-889e-00e7b2c247db.png)\r\n",
